<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
    <subsection xml:id="timedwork"><title>Initial Drafts of Work in Timed Settings</title>
     <p>
    Initial drafts of work done in class (a setting with limited time) are not expected to be typeset. Instead,
    high resolution images or digital scans of your initial work can be included in your portfolio.
     </p>
     <p>
    Reflections on your work, revisions, and corrections, though, are expected to follow the guidelines
     given for work in un-timed settings.
     </p>
     </subsection>
